# Document

"role.slip.ability.slip" : "<title>Slip</title>Squeeze through a closed door and move to the opposite side of it.<br>Slipping sideways squashes your body vertically and stretches it horizontally, while slipping up or down makes your body thin and stretches it lengthwise."

